        "source_sentence": "A round-bottomed flask equipped with an $\\Nu _ { 2 }$inlet tube, condenser, and thermometer was charged with 0.005 mol of diamine and 10 ml of dry NMP. Then a solution containing 0.005 mol of diisocyanate in 10 ml of dry NMP was added in one lot to the flask contents. The solution was stirred for 1 hr at room temperature and 4 hr at $7 0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } ,$and then it was precipitated in water. The polymer was filtered, washed with hot water and methanol, and dried at vacuum oven at $8 0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$"
